Package: trama.multi
Title: Multivariate Analysis Collection for trama
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Pedro", "Mambelli Fernandes", , "pedromambelli@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-1695-279X")),
    person("João Paulo Assis", "Bonifácio", , "jpab.27@hotmail.com",
           role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-2335-8391"))
  )
Description: Nodes for multivariate analysis in a trama graph: principal
    component analysis with scree, biplot and correlation circle; factor
    analysis by maximum likelihood or principal axis, with orthogonal
    (varimax, quartimax, equamax) and oblique (promax, oblimin) rotations;
    linear and quadratic discriminant analysis with cross-validated
    confusion matrices; logistic regression (binary and multinomial) as a
    classifier, with leave-one-out predictions and ROC curves; jackknife
    bias, standard errors and pseudovalues for component, factor,
    discriminant and logistic statistics; and the diagnostics that come
    first (KMO, Bartlett's sphericity, Horn's parallel analysis, Box's M).
    Ships example data with known structure. Builds on trama.data for
    tables and trama.view for plots.
